    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "We have a table named Orders with columns order_id, customer_id, order_date, and delivery_date."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "And we need to retrieve the number of orders delivered in exactly 3 days of the order date."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "To solve this problem, we must figure out how to add 3 days to every order_date and check it against the corresponding delivery_date."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "If there is a match, we will return a count of 1. The sum of all counts will give us the number of orders delivered in exactly 3 days."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Hence, we need the following functions for this program:"
    },
    {
      "type": "bullet_list",
      "items": [
        "COUNT() - to count the number of occurrences of order delivery in exactly 3 days",
        "DATE() - to add the number of days to the order_date column"
      ]
    },
